Here's an example of what I was talking about earlier.  Excalibur's
slightly lower than Frost Brand for random damage.  But against all of
the Angels, it's much worse (likewise liches if you don't geno them).
I'd much rather have Excalibur as far as survivability, since all
those extra .75 hp damage against random dungeon peons are relative
unlikely to help me survive compared to not having it crap out in a
more dire situation.  Likewise I'd take Snickersnee over Fire Brand
any time just for real-game damage distribution, even though they're
tied here.

